Subject to applicable law:

10.1 You retain rights in original data, prompts, research material, experiments, analyses, and other content that You independently provide.

10.2 The Licensor does not acquire ownership of an Output solely because the Software produced it.

10.3 Research papers, benchmark reports, measurements, experimental observations, and independently authored analyses created through permitted use remain the property of their respective authors.

10.4 If an Output contains substantial portions copied from the Licensed Materials, rights in those reproduced portions remain unaffected.

