## 14. Hosted Services and Remote Access

You may not provide third-party access to the Licensed Materials or materially equivalent protected functionality as a Hosted Service without separate written authorization.

This includes SaaS, APIs, hosted agents, managed services, web applications, paid remote execution, or similar offerings.

Temporary access by members of the same non-commercial research team for permitted collaborative research is allowed.

