## 17. Ethical and Safety Restrictions

The Licensed Materials may not be used for Offensive Use.

Without separate written authorization, the Licensed Materials may not be used by or for:

17.1 weapons systems;

17.2 lethal autonomous systems;

17.3 offensive cyber operations;

17.4 harmful target selection;

17.5 unlawful surveillance;

17.6 coercive profiling or social control;

17.7 activities materially intended to harm people or critical civil infrastructure.

Separate authorization may be granted for defensive, humanitarian, medical, disaster-response, search-and-rescue, safety, demining, environmental, or other public-interest activities.

